Error [jet.UnknownArgumentLabel]: `Container.make` has no parameter labelled `depth`
  --> tests/ui/label_unknown.jet:8:41
    |
  8 | run: fn() { _: Container.make(width: 5, depth: 3) }
    |                                         ^^^^^
 Why: A label binds an argument to the parameter of that name
 Fix: `Container.make` accepts `width`, `height`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0764
